    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get the original &quot;Angels of Death&quot; here!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>&quot;The boy made up his mind to face a cruel world.&quot;</i> <br><br>The new special edition &quot;Episode.Eddie&quot; which is included in the first volume of Blu-ray &amp; DVD of the anime \u201cAngels of Death&quot; is now available on Steam.<br>The past of B4 floor master Eddie is revealed\u2026!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1321230/extras/066db80364a2a9b9bae5adc9553823fc.avif?t=1714473218\" /></div><br>Eddie was born into a cemetery clan as the third son.<br>He loved his family's work more than anyone else and worked hard every day to make graves, even though he could not take over the family business.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1321230/extras/33a8d9968818f5c7aff153772a999f56.avif?t=1714473218\" /></div><br>However, behind the scenes, Eddie has a secret: abuse from his eldest son.<br>Unbeknownst to his family, the violence only grew more intense by the day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1321230/extras/00f09fd7ccb13a4f545d9b32ad3dc21f.avif?t=1714473218\" /></div><br>Then one day, he meets a mysterious girl in a graveyard.<br>Eddie is attracted to a lovely girl with strange eyes and goes to see her every night.<br>Eventually, however, as the days turn to hell, Eddie realizes that he's not the only one.<br>She was also like him, in that her body's wounds were increasing by the day.....<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1321230/extras/fce694b29f09c7fb256f25c42464763a.avif?t=1714473218\" /></div><br>This work is listed as a bonus of the anime &quot;Angels of Death&quot; Blu-ray/DVD, which is now on sale.<br>This time, thanks to the kindness of everyone involved, it is a stand-alone release. <br>If you are interested in the anime in this work, please consider purchasing the Blu-ray/DVD as well.<br>*We have long requested refraining from live-streaming gameplay of this title, but as of April 30, 2024, it is now permitted.",
